
# MP Runtime Skill File V2

## Status
Version 2 (Expanded Command Inventory)

## Purpose
Knowledge base for interpreting MP wrapper scripts, runtime topology, command definitions, parameters, and conversion relevance.

# Runtime Administration Commands

## mp job <jobname>
Purpose: Create a job container and store subsequent MP definitions.
Parameters:
- jobname

## mp reset
Purpose: Reset stored job definitions.

## mp show
Purpose: Display stored definitions.

## mp check
Purpose: Validate stored definitions.

## mp comment <text>
Purpose: Add documentation comments.

## mp run
Reporting Parameters:
- -report verbose-errors
- -report expanded-graph
- -report flows
- -report table-flows
- -report file-percentages
- -report times
- -report spillage
- -report totals
- -report skew
- -report scroll
- -report file
- -report interval
- -report show-folding
Purpose: Runtime reporting and execution.

# Definition Commands

## mp file / ifile / ofile / iofile
Parameters:
- name
- url
- -flags
- -mode
- -create-directories
- -format
- -xmf
- -rxmf
- -xmf_type
- -hadoop-codec
Purpose: Logical file definitions.

## mp layout
Forms:
- layout name partition...
- layout name -hosts hostname...
Purpose: Execution topology definition.

## mp metadata
Forms:
- metadata name -file filename
- metadata name -string value
- -family
Purpose: Schema definition.

## mp include
Purpose: Include DML/XFR files.

## mp error
Purpose: Error routing definition.

